# NOTE: dist/ is intentionally COMMITTED (not ignored). This package is consumed as a git dependency
# (github:NubeDev/lb-ext-ui-sdk#<tag>) whose main/types point at ./dist. pnpm 11 blocks a git dep's
# `prepare`/build scripts unless allowlisted, so shipping a prebuilt dist is the reliable way for a
# consumer to resolve types with zero build step — the same convention lb uses for packages/*/dist.
